			<zone xml:id="p2z8-0" points="1358,1909 1394,1916 1421,1936 1436,1936 1448,1788 1416,1780 1406,1783 1399,1776 1385,1785 1366,1788">1369,1892 1394,1890 1419,1888 1444,1886</zone>
